OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 shell 'livened up' heritage
OL,4,Aaudit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bomb squad was called out to check
OL,7,Fover a World War Two shell which had
OL,8,F"livened up" an audit at a heritage
OL,9,Farchive.
OL,11,FVolunteers at Kirkgate Arts and
OL,12,FHeritage, which hold artefacts and
OL,13,Fmemorabilia in Cockermouth, Cumbria,
OL,14,Fwere completing an audit of its
OL,15,Fcollection before moving it to improved
OL,16,Fstorage, when they came across the
OL,17,Fshell.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787635598
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 shell 'livened up' heritage
OL,4,Aaudit
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity projects officer Helen
OL,7,FJohnston said the team was aware
OL,8,Fsomeone had donated a brass artillery
OL,9,Fshell 30 years ago, but it had not been
OL,10,Fchecked over formally.
OL,12,F"I've seen shells before, but this was
OL,13,Fheavier and much more complete,"
OL,14,FJohnston said, adding: "I did think,
OL,15,F'Well it's been here for 30 years so if
OL,16,Fwe don't disturb it we'll be fine'."
